# MCQ bank

Source of truth: `ai-workspace/mcq-crud-prd.md`. Shared ungated four-choice
questions. Do not add cookies, JWT, sessions, author columns, or route guards
unless a new PRD asks for them.

## Layering

```
McqList / McqForm   ('use client')
  Server Actions    src/app/mcqs/actions.ts
    Zod             src/lib/mcq-schemas.ts
      mcq-service   src/lib/services/mcq-service.ts
        D1          getCloudflareContext({ async: true })
```

JSON route handlers under `src/app/api/mcqs/` remain for the HTTP contract.
UI mutations go through Server Actions. Actions must not use `env.DB`.

The `/mcqs` dashboard loads the list in a Server Component (`force-dynamic`)
and passes `initialMcqs` into `McqList`. Do not fetch `/api/mcqs` from the
client or `setState` in `useEffect` to hydrate the table. Row actions are
Preview (dialog), Edit (`/mcqs/[id]/edit`), and Delete (confirm dialog).
Create Question goes to `/mcqs/new`. New/Edit forms use a Question textarea
(stored as `prompt`), four choices A–D, radios for exactly one correct,
Save/Cancel, and a Saving status. Do not add 2–6 choice UI or a description
column. Logout stays `POST /api/auth/logout`.

## Validation

`mcqInputSchema`: trimmed prompt (1–2000), choices A–D (1–500, pairwise
distinct), `correct` A/B/C/D. Missing id → `Question not found`.

## Public shape

`{ id, prompt, choiceA, choiceB, choiceC, choiceD, correct, createdAt, updatedAt }`
